    "notes": "Typed main_soa per the taxonomy decision tree: rows are activities for all patients; the columns are NOT the same as Table A1 (no Screening column; a single D -5 column instead of 'D -5, -4, -3'; M2, M3, M4 and M6 combined into one column), so domain/continuation are excluded; not finer timing (subsidiary); every participant passes through it (not track). One label column (L=1); data positions 2-11. The label column is one cell spanning header rows 1-3 that prints 'Procedure' (heading of the activity column), so the three header band names are synthesised. Doc p.103 carries only the reprinted header (rows 15-18, not emitted) and the notes/footnotes. Row 9 col 3 prints 'X (before TAK-007 administration' without a closing parenthesis; transcribed as printed. Flat table, no group bands."
